README for eval folder

1. May2021: Subfolder "TaylorLagrange"
	contains the code and data used in our ISSAC 2021 paper,

		"Novel Range Functions via Taylor Expansions and Recursive
		 Lagrange Interpolation with Application to Real Root Isolation"
			by
		K.Hormann, L.Kania and C.Yap.
	
	You should be able to reproduce our results using
	the Makefile targets.

2. May2023:  Subfolder "hermiteLevel"
	contains the code and data used in our 2023 CASC paper,

		"Range Functions of Any Convergence Order and
					their Amortized Complexity Analysis"
			by
		Kai Hormann, Chee Yap and Ya Shi Zhang

	You should be able to reproduce our results using
	the Makefile targets.

3. Dec2025:  Subfolder "bivariateRange"
	contains the code and data used in our 2025 GMP submission,

		"Bivariate range functions with superior convergence order"
			by
		Thomas Chen, Kai Hormann, Chee Yap and Bingwei Zhang

	You should be able to reproduce our results using
	the Makefile targets.

